<title>NETHERLANDS: Table - ASR (Stad R'dam) H1 results.</title>
<headline>Table - ASR (Stad R'dam) H1 results.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-08-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>First half 1997</p>
<p>(in millions of guilders unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Net per shr (guilders)	     2.54 vs   1.98</p>
<p>    Net profit			    86.5  vs  62.2</p>
<p>NOTE - Analysts had expected ASR Verzekeringsgroep NV, which was previously called Stad Rotterdam Anno 1720 NV, to report a net profit of 74 million to 78 million guilders.  </p>
<p>    Turnover (billions)			    2.48 vs   2.04</p>
<p>    Tax						 38.6  vs  31.6</p>
<p>    Minorities charge				8.0  vs  15.9</p>
<p>Breakdown turnover per sector:</p>
<p>    - premium income life insurance	  843.5  vs 647.6</p>
<p>    - premium income non-life insurance    915.4  vs 777.5</p>
<p>    - investment income			  715.6  vs 614.7</p>
<p>Breakdown pre-tax profit per sector</p>
<p>    - Life insurance				63.2  vs  52.9</p>
<p>    - Non-life insurance			  50.0  vs  45.2</p>
<p>    - Other activities			    13.4  vs  11.6</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000</p>
</text>
